codexbar-linux (0.1.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Development package for the upstream-CLI-only GNOME Shell companion.
  * Install user-scoped D-Bus activation, systemd user unit, extension assets,
    and GSettings schema without auto-enabling the extension.
  * Ship codexbar-linux-setup for user-run package activation and default
    provider settings.
  * Align daemon package metadata with the v0.1 candidate and ship
    codexbar-linuxd(1).

 -- CodexBar GNOME Maintainers <maintainers@example.invalid>  Mon, 04 May 2026 12:00:00 +0000
